    <!-- Tabler Icons (MIT), one Geometry per icon, keyed Tabler.<name>.
         GENERATED FILE - tools/gen_icons.py emits this from the vendored SVGs. Do not hand-edit:
         the geometries below were transcribed against the same 24x24 stroke-2 grid so the
         generator replaces the file wholesale without any caller changing.

         Every icon is stroke-based: draw it as a stroked Path, never filled, with
         StrokeThickness 2 and round caps and joins, inside a Viewbox so the stroke scales with
         the icon. Tabler's leading "M0 0h24v24H0z" bounding-box rectangle is omitted, because a
         stroked Path would draw it. -->

